sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Simulator (OEM cloud)
  participant GW as Ingest gateway
  participant K as Kafka
  participant N as Normalizer (EOS v2)
  participant C as ClickHouse sink
  S->>GW: POST batch (500 events)
  GW->>K: produce, acks=all
  Note over K: broker killed (SIGKILL)
  K--xGW: timeout / not leader
  GW-->>S: 503 + Retry-After (nothing acknowledged)
  Note over GW: 5 failures: circuit opens, fast 503s
  S->>S: keep batch, back off, retry (never drop)
  Note over K: broker restarted, healthy after 70 s
  S->>GW: retry same batch (may duplicate)
  GW->>K: produce, acks=all
  GW-->>S: 202 accepted (durable)
  K->>N: consume raw
  N->>N: dedup on (VIN, seq) window, drop repeat
  N->>K: canonical + offsets in one transaction
  K->>C: consume canonical
  C->>K: commit intent (first..last)
  C->>C: INSERT with token topicId:partition:first-last
  C->>K: commit last+1
  Note over S,C: reconciled: 2,874,026 sent = stored = rollup
